   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The story jumps back to Sapporo in 1980. Instead of making door-to-door sales calls, Toru Muranishi is killing time inside a noisy coffeehouse arcade. When schoolboys start shouting over a tabletop video game, Muranishi snaps at them. Listen to the rough, casual speech first.",
